#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "FAQs Donations"
msgstr "FAQ Donasi"

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What payment methods can I use to donate?"
msgstr "Metode pembayaran apa yang dapat saya gunakan untuk berdonasi?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Open Collective, Liberapay, and direct bank transfer."
msgstr "Open Collective, Liberapay, dan transfer bank langsung."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Can I donate just once, or do I have to set up recurring donations?"
msgstr "Bisakah saya berdonasi sekali saja, atau saya harus menyiapkan donasi berkala?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "You can donate once, or set up recurring donations. Both are supported."
msgstr "Anda dapat berdonasi sekali, atau menyiapkan donasi berkala. Keduanya didukung."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Will I receive updates about how my donation impacts F-Droid?"
msgstr "Apakah saya akan menerima pembaruan tentang dampak donasi saya terhadap F-Droid?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Yes! You can follow along in our weekly blog posts, in the forum, or in GitLab to track development progress."
msgstr "Ya! Anda dapat mengikuti perkembangannya melalui posting blog mingguan kami, di forum, atau di GitLab untuk melacak progres pengembangan."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Join us in keeping software free and accessible!"
msgstr "Bergabunglah bersama kami untuk menjaga perangkat lunak tetap bebas dan mudah diakses!"

#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous Setup"
msgstr "Pengaturan Sebelumnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Donations for F-Droid were previously handled by F-Droid Limited, a UK \"private company\" registered in England (no. [08420676](https://beta.companieshouse.gov.uk/company/08420676)).  It has been out of use since 2021."
msgstr "Donasi untuk F-Droid sebelumnya ditangani oleh F-Droid Limited, \"perusahaan swasta\" Inggris Raya yang terdaftar di Inggris (no. [08420676](https://beta.companieshouse.gov.uk/company/08420676)).  Sudah tidak digunakan sejak tahun 2021."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Permasalahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengalami masalah tentang F-Droid, silakan laporkan ke pelacak masalah yang terkait."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "Aplikasi Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengalami masalah dengan aplikasi klien F-Droid (aplikasi toko aplikasi kami), mohon periksa jika kami sudah tahu tentang itu, dan/atau laporkan ke dalam [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "Data Aplikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "Untuk masalah berkaitan dengan konten repositori F-Droid (aplikasi dalam toko aplikasi kami), seperti aplikasi hilang atau lawas, silakan menggunakan [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "Permintaan untuk Pengemasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr "Untuk meminta aplikasi baru untuk dikemas (tambah aplikasi ke toko aplikasi kami), mohon periksa pelacak masalah data aplikasi terlebih dahulu untuk melihat jika aplikasinya sudah tersedia di masa lalu dan dihapus. Permintaan untuk pengemasan tersisa dapat ditambahkan ke [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "Peralatan Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "Untuk masalah pada peralatan server (membangun aplikasi secara mandiri atau menjalakan repo Anda sendiri), silakan menggunakan [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Situs Web"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "Untuk masalah berkaitan dengan situs web ini, Anda dapat menggunakan [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "Pencarian Situs Web"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "Untuk masalah berkaitan dengan https://search.f-droid.org atau hasil pencarian di situs web ini, Anda dapat menggunakan [pelacak masalah ini](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "Selang Kebakaran"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "Jika Anda belum menemukan tempat yang tepat, cobalah mencari di [semua isu](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/) yang dilacak oleh proyek F-Droid."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgid "The F-Droid app store is essentially a collection of apps created by individuals all around the world. Collections of apps are also called repositories, or repos for short. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you can create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "F-Droid.org hanyalah satu repositori dari ratusan repo yang diciptakan oleh individu-individu di seluruh dunia. Dengan peralatan F-Droid, semua orang dapat membuat repo sendiri. Jadi apakah Anda seorang musisi yang ingin mempublikasikan musik mereka atau pengembang yang ingin melayani penyusunan aplikasi mereka setiap malam, Anda bebas untuk membuat repo sendiri dan membagikannya dengan orang lain secara independen dari F-Droid.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgid "In the past, creating a repo was difficult because you had to have knowledge of the command line, needed to know how to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them displayed inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "Di masa lalu, membuat repo cukup sulit karena Anda harus memiliki pengetahuan tentang baris perintah, perlu mengedit berkas teks untuk mengedit detail penyimpanan paket dan harus menempelkan tangkapan layar di sistem direktori khusus agar dapat disajikan dengan baik di dalam aplikasi F-Droid."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This process is simplified thanks to Repomaker. Now you can create your own mini app store, using our simplified interface, guiding you through every step in the process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "Ini semua menjadi lebih mudah sekarang: dengan Repomaker, Anda dapat membuat repositori sendiri dan tidak perlu memiliki pengetahuan khusus untuk melakukannya.  Lihat [panduan instalasi](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/readme.md#Installation)  untuk informasi tentang bagaimana Anda dapat memasang Repomaker di perangkat Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Try out the demo test instance <https://repomakerdemo.fdroid.net> and tell us what you think."
msgstr ""

